From a9daa3c42f273bd80c335246230a832038b30b90 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 22:08:35 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: Add Molmo2 multimodal runner (sidecar
 preprocessing, causal)

Assemble the Molmo2 image block (pooled patch features plus special
start/end/column tokens from the Molmo2 extra embedding table) as the
vision embedding and emit every image-block position as image_token_id,
so the shared embeddingLookup path injects it without enlarging the LLM
vocabulary. Image preprocessing and input_ids come from a per-request
sidecar produced by the HF processor.

